        "official_en_sha256": "d74591b51e089d0f60971d7bdef0e6b6635d2377db619dac652d304642e4e2a9"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そう。\r\n最終決戦って感じになってきたわね。",
        "official_en": "Indeed. It appears the final battle is upon us.",
        "real_en": "Yeah. It's starting to feel like the final battle."
      },
