        "official_en_sha256": "4c33259149e43442d75947be2dae3f1a7dda45e3942bbd6469bf1fd620f44c48"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "た、大変です！\r\n先行した部隊がアルドールの待ち伏せに遭遇しました！\r\n現在も交戦中です！",
        "official_en": "A...a report, sirs! The vanguard was ambushed by Aldorian troops! They’re battling as we speak!",
        "real_en": "T-terrible news! Our advance unit was ambushed by Aldore's troops! They're still fighting!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
