        "official_en_sha256": "463cf23d2b6c01a74871616dd92df4a0d7202db570d67b523fd71f4c5af62689"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ただでさえ戦力が少ないのだ。\r\nこれ以上、犠牲者が出るのはまずい。",
        "official_en": "We’re already outnumbered... We can’t afford to lose any more men.",
        "real_en": "We're already short on fighting strength. We can't afford any more casualties."
      },
