      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "仲間がやられたときは\r\nいつも胸が張り裂けそうな気分になる。",
        "official_en": "Nothing hurts my heart more than the loss of a brother-in-arms.",
        "real_en": "Whenever one of our comrades falls, it feels like my heart is breaking."
